{"seq":5,"slug":"philosophy-of-technology","title":"技术哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"philosophy-logic","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 技术哲学：反思人类所创造之物\n\n## 定位与边界\n\n技术哲学从哲学视角审视技术的本质、技术与社会的关系以及技术发展的价值取向，帮助我们超越\"技术是中性工具\"的朴素假设，追问技术如何改变人的存在方式、技术与权力的关系，以及人类是否有能力驾驭自己创造的技术系统。在哲学与逻辑类目中，「科学哲学」探讨科学理论与方法的哲学问题，本 hub 则聚焦科学知识的应用产物及其社会后果；「伦理学基础」提供道德哲学的一般框架，本 hub 将伦理分析具体化到技术情境中；「心灵哲学」讨论意识与认知的本质，本 hub 中的后人类主义和人工智能讨论与之呼应。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 hub 共四章，从本体论反思到社会分析再到数字时代的前沿议题：\n\n**第一章 技术的本质**——探讨\"什么是技术\"这一基本问题：技术的定义与分类、技术决定论与社会建构论的张力、人工物的哲学分析、技术与人性的关系。\n\n**第二章 技术与社会**——分析技术与社会之间的复杂互动：技术的社会建构（SCOT）、行动者网络理论（ANT）、技术与权力结构的关系、数字鸿沟的伦理维度。\n\n**第三章 数字哲学**——聚焦数字技术引发的独特哲学问题：虚拟现实的本体论地位、信息哲学的核心概念、后人类主义的挑战、注意力经济对主体性的侵蚀。\n\n**第四章 技术伦理前沿**——探讨最紧迫的技术伦理挑战：自主系统的道德地位、监控技术与隐私、生物技术伦理、存在性风险的哲学分析。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习。第一章提供哲学基础，第二章展开社会维度，第三章聚焦当下的数字生活，第四章面向未来。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n无需哲学专业背景。建议具备：对日常技术使用的反思意识、对\"技术是否中性\"这一问题的好奇心、基本的论证分析能力。有技术开发经验者将更容易将哲学讨论与个人实践联系起来。\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [科学哲学](../02_philosophy-of-science/)——理解科学方法与理论的哲学基础\n- [应用伦理](../17_applied-ethics/)——更广泛的实践伦理议题框架\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technology-nature","title":"技术的本质","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-nature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-technology","title":"技术的定义与本质","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-nature/what-is-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"technological-determinism","title":"技术决定论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-nature/technological-determinism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"philosophy-of-artifacts","title":"人工物哲学","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-nature/philosophy-of-artifacts"},{"seq":4,"slug":"technology-and-human-nature","title":"技术与人性","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-nature/technology-and-human-nature"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technology-society","title":"技术与社会","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-society","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-construction-tech","title":"技术的社会建构","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-society/social-construction-tech"},{"seq":2,"slug":"actor-network-theory","title":"行动者网络理论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-society/actor-network-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-and-power","title":"技术与权力","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-society/technology-and-power"},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-divide","title":"数字鸿沟","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/technology-society/digital-divide"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-philosophy","title":"数字哲学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/digital-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-reality-ontology","title":"虚拟现实本体论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/digital-philosophy/virtual-reality-ontology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-philosophy","title":"信息哲学","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/digital-philosophy/information-philosophy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"posthumanism","title":"后人类主义","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/digital-philosophy/posthumanism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"attention-economy","title":"注意力经济哲学","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/digital-philosophy/attention-economy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"tech-ethics-frontier","title":"技术伦理前沿","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/tech-ethics-frontier","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"autonomous-systems","title":"自主系统伦理","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/tech-ethics-frontier/autonomous-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"surveillance-ethics","title":"监控与隐私哲学","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/tech-ethics-frontier/surveillance-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biotechnology-ethics","title":"生物技术伦理","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/tech-ethics-frontier/biotechnology-ethics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"existential-risk","title":"存在性风险","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-technology/tech-ethics-frontier/existential-risk"}]}]}